## Mathematical unit

Characterize equality in the support-resolvent moment log-convexity / Turán hierarchy and lift it to the actual physical positive spectral support.

### Generic core
- prove `⟨A^(n+1)u,u⟩² = ⟨A^n u,u⟩⟨A^(n+2)u,u⟩ ↔ ∃ r, A u = r • u` for injective positive self-adjoint real continuous linear maps;
- use a weighted-variance vector `z = a • A u - b • u` and strict positivity of `A^n`;
- specialize to the coercive ambient resolvent;
- identify equality of consecutive factorial-normalized derivative ratios with a single resolvent spectral mode.

### Physical support
- package the bounded one-step positive-support resolvent eigenmode condition behind a generic native-support predicate;
- lift the derivative-ratio equality characterization to the actual periodic hypercubic SU(N) physical excitation support.

